       id="SQLite-API" title="SQLite API">

    <title>
        SQLite API
    </title>
    <p>The ByteLib SQLite API is an opinionated yet extensible SQLite wrapper that abstracts away much of the
        boilerplate that comes with using SQLite. It also provides a ton of quality-of-life features.</p>
    <p>The goal of the SQLite API was to design it in a way that it looks like an ORM but still allows developers to use
        all the power of raw SQL.</p>

</topic>